('p-cf-29', 'Women Half Turtleneck Zip Cardigan Winter Knit Loose Fit', 'women-half-turtleneck-zip-cardigan-winter-knit-loose-fit', 'MKZ-648914', 'Stay warm and look effortlessly chic this winter with our new arrival cardigan. Perfect for Pakistan’s chilly evenings, this stylish piece combines comfort with timeless design, making it ideal for both casual outings and office wear. The soft, thick knitted fabric ensures durability and warmth without sacrificing elegance.

