('p-cf-30', 'Women Knitted Cardigan Brown Button Autumn Style', 'women-knitted-cardigan-brown-button-autumn-style', 'MKZ-648908', 'Perfect for the crisp autumn days in Pakistan, this stylish cardigan offers both comfort and elegance for every occasion. Whether you''re heading to work, a family gathering, or a casual outing, this piece effortlessly blends classic design with modern flair. Made from premium quality knitted fabric, it’s designed to be durable and long-lasting, ensuring you get the best price in Pakistan without compromising on style or comfort.

This cardigan features a flattering V-neckline and a classic cable-knit pattern that adds texture and sophistication. The buttons are sturdy and well-placed for easy wear, while the soft fabric hugs your frame without restricting movement. Ideal for middle-aged mothers and fashion-conscious women, it’s a versatile addition to any wardrobe. The short, fitted silhouette ensures a modern look that pairs beautifully with jeans, skirts, or trousers.

